        </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17984019\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4cee/b9bb/189378_normal.png?m=1753970238\" alt=\"Kinnice\" data-uid=\"189378\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Kinnice\">Kinnice</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 21:20:55 +08:00\">4h 50m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>可以写个网桥，把文件转成第三方的外链 url</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17984061\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9d12885de19cb15bdbe0344c6a789de1?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"BlueSkyXN\" data-uid=\"531301\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/BlueSkyXN\">BlueSkyXN</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 21:38:20 +08:00\">4h 32m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>直连就行了，结合 cf 全家桶（ cfaigw 、warp 、cfcdn 、cfworker 等产品）</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17984176\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ddd927d69f7ccbf8e9b5a77c7b8500f5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yinmin\" data-uid=\"108246\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yinmin\">yinmin</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-17 22:35:10 +08:00\">3h 36m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不要在对话框里贴图，把图片保存在项目目录里，然后在对话框里引用图片文件路径</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17984386\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f5f0/6f7e/204968_normal.png?m=1747014329\" alt=\"id7368\" data-uid=\"204968\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/id7368\">id7368</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-18 01:36:41 +08:00\">34 mins ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>很多人遇到了，一张图被反复发，你发的图越多，反复发的次数也越高，几百 GB 流量轻轻松松被干完</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17984396\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5987/bc50/78391_normal.png?m=1782750130\" alt=\"yidinghe\" data-uid=\"78391\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yidinghe\">yidinghe</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-18 02:05:14 +08:00\">6 mins ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你已经看到问题原因了，那肯定是要把图片从上下文去掉才行。图片读一次就没用了。找找有没有这方面的插件</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"ktyang · 8h 26m ago · 962 views 前段时间使用 codex 处理图片相关的任务比较多，观测到了大量的异常流量消耗，夸张的时候到了一天 200G 的程度。大概猜测原因呢是图片一直在上下文里面滚来滚去，一步步叠加就流量爆表了。找了一下似乎也没有特别完美的解决方案，看看大家有没有好的解决方法。给还没有意识到这个问题的朋友们也提个醒。 Codex 流量 图片12 replies • 2026-08-18 02:05:14 +08:00 2 sskycn 7h 13m ago 你也在用手机流量吗？ 4 tinx 6h 22m ago 我也是，我还怀疑因此我换了花云实验节点，导致 chatgpt 直接封号了 5 sskycn 5h 42m ago 我用的 esim ，有次不小心，一天干完我 50G 。 7 